'''Toon Skins''' are wearable cosmetic redesigns of playable characters. They are obtained via purchasing from [[Dyle's Store]], [[Bobette's Store|Bobette's Christmas Shop]], [[Bassie's Store|Bassie's Easter Shop]], [[Gourdy's Store|Gourdy's Halloween Shop]], buying a [[Gamepass]] Skin via [https://www.roblox.com/upgrades/robux?ctx=navpopover Robux], or completing [[Quests]], like [[Mastery]] quests, [[Event]]-exclusive quests, or Toon of the Week quests.

===Toon Skin System===
Purchasable Skins are obtained by going to [[Dyle's Store]], going to the Skins category and choosing which Skin to buy for 600 {{TI|Ichor|name=true}}. 

During the [[Easter Event]], [[Halloween Event]], and [[Christmas Event]], you can buy Holiday Skins with {{TI|Baskets|name=true}}, {{TI|Pumpkins|name=true}}, and {{TI|Ornaments|name=true}} respectively in each Event's corresponding Event Store. You can also buy Skins with animated trails for 1200 Ichor with 1200 of the event’s currency (either Baskets, Pumpkins, or Ornaments.)

